{"title": "[花邊] Baron Davis: LBJ走後 湖人終於能正常打球", "author": "usnavyseal (usmarine2008)", "board": "", "date": "Tue Oct 27 11:01:56 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793070118.A.DAE.html", "body": "https://youtu.be/kysVAi3Q1NY?&t=662\n 11:02開始\n\n最近Baron Davis上Gilbert arenas談湖人的近況\n\nI do want to say one things about these, Lakers man. It's going to get the\nLakers are going to be a better team because now you can actually coach and\nhave an imprint. Like having LeBron you don’t have philosophy, you don’t\nhave a system now when LeBron is gone it’s like, Okay I’m the coach I can\nbuild around you saw what it look like with Austin Reaves and Luka last year\nwithout LeBron, right? People got really excited. And it was pretty like\npeople got really excited.\n\n我確實想講一下湖人這支球隊，湖人會變得更好，因為現在你終於可以真正執教，並且在\n\n球隊留下自己的影響。像有 LeBron 在的時候，你就沒有自己的執教理念，也沒有自己的\n\n體系。現在當LeBron不在了，情況就變成：「好，我是總教練，我可以開始打造球隊了」\n\n你們去年也看過 LeBron 不在的時候，Austin Reaves 和 Luka 搭檔打出來是什麼樣子，\n\n對吧？大家當時真的很興奮。而且那時候確實就是，大家都非常興奮。\n\nNow you're looking at Luka coming into this year and it's like, okay, this is\na different Luka just on that last play with him just ripping the ball and\nstealing the ball, even getting down on the floor. It's like you can tell\nthat he is stepping up to a different type of leadership and he won it. So\neven if I can't play defense, I can give a defensive effort.\n現在你再看看今年的 Luka，就會覺得：「好，這是一個不一樣的 Luka。」光看剛才最後\n那個回合，他直接把球搶過來，完成抄截，甚至還撲倒在地板上。你可以看得出來，\n\n他正在展現出一種不同層次的領導能力，而且他想贏球。所以就算我不擅長防守，\n\n至少我可以在防守端付出努力。\n\nThen you start thinking about all those versatile dudes that the Lakers got\naround at the two, three, four, five, like it just gives him so many\ndifferent pieces to work with. When you watch him play one on five, it's\nlike, well, shit anybody could have been on the court.\n\n然後你開始想想，湖人在2號位、3號位、4號位、5號位周圍擁有的那些功能多元的球員，\n\n這真的讓他有非常多不同的球員可以運用。當你看著他1個人打4個人的時候，你就會覺得\n\n：「靠，那誰在場上根本都沒差啊。」\n\nAnybody could be on the court now. They got the right pieces. They got the\nright versatility to come down to be able to subsidize his lack of defense,\nright? But all he has to do now is give an effort, and it looked like he's\nwilling to give an effort or willing to be in the right space.\n但現在誰在場上就有差了。他們現在有了正確的球員配置，也有了足夠的陣容靈活性，能\n夠彌補他在防守上的不足，對吧？而他現在唯一需要做的，就是在防守端付出努力。看起\n來他也願意這麼做，或者至少願意出現在正確的防守位置上。\n\nSo, you know, I'm excited for Luka more so to see his leadership evolve.\nLike people not going to be able to just say like, \"Oh, he just don’t play\ndefense.\" Like I think he's going to turn into, you know, like not a great\ndefender, but somebody who's not as not a liability like he used to be.\n所以我更期待看到 Luka 的領導能力如何持續成長。\n\n大家以後可能就沒辦法再只是說：「喔，他就是不防守啊。」我覺得他會逐漸變成，\n\n你知道，不是什麼很出色的防守者，但至少不會再像以前那樣，成為球隊防守端的負擔。\n\n備註\n大膽！\n現在Luka更積極的防守？", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "Dong02", "content": "big膽！", "time": "10/27 11:02"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Israfil", "content": "什麼 原本不能正常打嗎", "time": "10/27 11:02"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "JaegwonKim", "content": "又一個生活不如意", "time": "10/27 11:03"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "KhePri", "content": "你發瘋啦", "time": "10/27 11:03"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "iammatrix", "content": "不用幫老害補防守破洞就是積極防守了", "time": "10/27 11:04"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "mouz", "content": "這誰啊？幾冠？講話有什麼可信力嗎？", "time": "10/27 11:04"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "brian040818", "content": "真正的陣容年輕化", "time": "10/27 11:05"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "brian040818", "content": "就是把某個身兼GM+教練的排掉", "time": "10/27 11:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Q12345Q", "content": "其實就是應該拆啦 防守洞太多 拆開對雙方才好", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nottell", "content": "大膽！", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Hiroshi21", "content": "湖人今年肯定總冠軍了吧嘻嘻", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "UD305", "content": "大旱", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "jorden", "content": "生活不如意", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "xjapan329", "content": "這位Davis有鄉民懂球嗎", "time": "10/27 11:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "immence", "content": "造反了造反了 大膽刁民竟敢口出狂言對聖上不敬", "time": "10/27 11:06